cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CladeMers, please cite this software and report the software version,
  reference database release, taxonomy snapshot, and command used.
type: software
title: 'CladeMers: exact lineage-specific k-mer discovery from nucleotide references'
authors:
  - family-names: Bobo
    given-names: Dean M.
version: 0.13.0
date-released: '2026-11-22'
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/deanbobo/CladeMers'
url: 'https://github.com/deanbobo/CladeMers'
abstract: >-
  CladeMers extracts distinct canonical nucleotide k-mers present in a selected
  taxonomic lineage and absent from the background in a supplied reference
  snapshot. It supports BLAST databases, plain or compressed FASTA, two taxonomy
  sources, checkpoint recovery, and per-clade reports and FASTA exports.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - k-mers
  - taxonomy
  - environmental DNA
  - marker discovery
